    "D monitor and forbidden transfer primitive remain identical frozen code objects; native financial core and frozen NO_TOPUP baselines remain byte-identical.",
    "Known fresh exact Guard50 observations create native paid protective exits; stale quality itself creates no warning exit. Ordinary newly signalled reductions and valid existing risk/terminal exits retain frozen execution rules.",
    "Mark risk runs immediately; whole same-clock funding batch completes before the healthy-only monitor. No halted baseline is resumed or retroactively rescued.",
    "Detached charged previews preserve real fallback inventory and cannot mutate live wallet, pending intents, settlement journals or mark clocks.",
    "Paid execution retains native latency, costs, shared capacity and five eligible-open renewal. Position takeover cancels affected old pending increases and requires a new causal signal for re-entry.",
    "Conditional collateral-forfeiture settlement explicitly records positive residual forfeiture and insurance overshoot absorption; genuine unpaid wallet debt is preserved.",
    "2023 original minute close proof reconstructs all 2628000 mark cells across 65 checksum-bound streams with zero derived cells; 2024 causal sidecar and exact unknown interval are unchanged.",
    "All selected targets, decision arrays and covariance arrays are byte-bound to original candidates; no parameter sweep, scaling, target replacement or outcome-selected tranche subset."
  ],
